    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banpo's Bridge Wondrous Worlds is a reimagining of the classic Japanese puzzle genre, <i><strong>Hashiwokakero</strong></i>, or hashi. Explore and experience a tranquil vastness while connecting islands of imaginative worlds with bridges, and play through an extensive catalog of increasingly difficult puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth tutorial for learning how to play hashi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 5 unlockable worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200+ puzzles\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
